@chapter Transient menu

@findex org-linear-menu
@samp{M-x org-linear-menu} gathers the package's commands in a transient menu. In the list of your issues@comma{} @samp{.} opens it; elsewhere the package binds it to no key@comma{} so bind it yourself if you use it often.

