Every key is always shown; @samp{b}@comma{} @samp{t}@comma{} @samp{c} and @samp{p} act on the issue at point@comma{} in the file or in the list of your issues. The @samp{a} key shows whether the mode is on@comma{} and the menu stays open after you press it.

